@@ -142,8 +143,8 @@ The fix belongs upstream in `android_device_epam_xenvm-trout`, the rc as an
 opt-in gated on a boot property. When it lands there, the rc and the two
 animation values are deleted from both copies -- this one and the workspace one.
 The rest of the overlay stays, because it belongs to this product: the dialer
-name in `framework-res` and the screen-off timeout. This repository then keeps
-the board files, that overlay and the DomA feature files.
+name in `framework-res`, the screen-off timeout and the A2DP audio focus. This
